{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:11112565ac965a69","name":"Spacer Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-11112565ac965a69","title":"Spacer Talent Tree","revision":18516,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:14:46Z","sha256":"a6ea2ab93ebcee1ce9c2437a6fc163d6fb902db063912f170dacb06ebfe050d5","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18516","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Spacer%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-11112565ac965a69","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You prowl the space lanes seeking wealth, fame, adventure, or something more. You're also pretty good with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," in general.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hyperdriven"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per day while aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},", you can add your Class Level as a bonus on a single attack roll, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ability Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ability_Check"},". The decision to add this bonus can be made after the result of the check is known.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Spacehound"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You take no penalty on attack rolls in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low_Gravity"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Zero-Gravity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Zero-Gravity"}," environments, and you ignore the debilitating effects of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Sickness"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Sickness","referenceId":"reference:2f3eb853aa6ae781"},". In addition, you are considered proficient with any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Weapon"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Starship Raider"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Spacehound"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a +1 bonus on attack rolls made while aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},". This bonus applies to attacks made with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Weapons"},", as well as personal weapons used aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stellar Warrior"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite: "]},{"tag":"b","children":["Spacehound"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you roll a Natural 20 on an attack roll made aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"},", you gain one temporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},". If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," is not used before the end of the encounter, it is lost. This Talent works with both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Weapons"}," and personal weapons used aboard a Starship.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cramped Quarters Fighting"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Starship Raider"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When adjacent to an obstacle or barrier, you gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cover"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cover"}," bonus to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Deep Space Raider"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Starship Raider"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whether you are taking on military targets on behalf of a resistance movement or you are out for personal gain, you are experienced at raiding Starships and similar targets. You can use each if the following Actions once per encounter:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Clear a Path:"]}," Your attack forces an enemy to alter course or move out of your way. You must be fighting aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," to use this Action. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", make a ranged attack. If the attack hits, on its next turn your target must move its Speed to a square that is not adjacent to you. If the target is an enemy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," engaged in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},", the target instead must attempt to disengage from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dogfight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dogfight","referenceId":"reference:d47b1a4208bcd07f"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Covering Fire:"]}," You squeeze off several shots as you escape pursuing enemies. As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", if you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", you may move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," up to twice its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," and make a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," with one of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},"-controlled ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," at any point during that movement. If you hit and deal damage to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," with this attack, the target ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," takes a -2 penalty to attack rolls against your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," until the end of your turn."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Disabling Fire:"]}," Make a ranged attack with your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapon"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapon"},". If you make this attack against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," and hit and deal damage, you can choose one of the following to take effect until the end of your next turn:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["One of the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Weapons"}," ceases to function."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["The target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," is reduced to 0."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["The target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"}," is disabled."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["The target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced to 2 squares (",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Scale"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Scale"},")."]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Make a Break for It"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Stellar Warrior"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, while on or in a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"},", you can move up to one-half your speed, or move the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," up to one-half its speed if you are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
